#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:466
#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:814
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Move from a successful build to useful feedback with shareable previews and bundle-size insights."
msgstr "透過可分享的預覽和應用程式包大小分析，將成功的建構轉化為有用的回饋。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:233
#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:754
